<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>About KorViana</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/tailwind.css">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body class="bg-bone font-sans text-ink">
  <%- include('partials/header') %>
  <main class="page-width py-10 sm:py-16">
    <section class="max-w-3xl pb-8 sm:pb-10">
      <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[.2em] text-gold-deep">ABOUT KORVIANA</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl leading-tight sm:text-5xl">Responsibility with a sense of purpose.</h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-7 text-muted sm:text-lg">Two distinct entities, one shared commitment to trust, dignity and meaningful progress.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2" aria-label="KorViana organisations">
      <article class="border-t border-hair py-6">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[.16em] text-gold-deep">PUBLIC BENEFIT</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl">KorViana Welfare Society</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">KorViana Welfare Society is a community-focused organisation based in Chumoukedima, Nagaland. It is committed to supporting people through practical welfare and development initiatives.</p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">The Society works in community welfare, healthcare support, education, livelihood development, women and youth empowerment, child welfare, financial awareness and other public-benefit activities. Its focus is helping individuals and families become more confident, capable and self-reliant while contributing to stronger, more resilient communities.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="border-t border-hair py-6">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[.16em] text-gold-deep">COMMERCIAL ENTERPRISE</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl">KorViana Ventures LLP</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">KorViana Ventures LLP is the commercial and business entity associated with the KorViana name. It has been created to undertake lawful trading, distribution, services and other commercial activities across different sectors.</p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">Its approach is based on transparency, proper documentation, responsible business practices and reliable customer service. It may operate in precious metals, consumer products, trading, distribution, e-commerce, business facilitation and other allied activities, subject to applicable laws and approvals.</p>
      </article>
    </section>
    <section class="mt-8 grid gap-6 border-t border-hair py-7 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[.16em] text-gold-deep">OUR APPROACH</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl">Distinct roles. Shared values.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm leading-7 text-muted">KorViana Welfare Society and KorViana Ventures LLP have different legal and operational roles. The Welfare Society focuses on social and public-benefit activities. KorViana Ventures LLP handles commercial and business activities. Both are guided by the same values of trust, responsibility, dignity and long-term development.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="mt-4 grid gap-6 border-t border-hair py-7 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[.16em] text-gold-deep">CONNECT WITH KORVIANA</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl">Let's stay in touch.</h2>
      </div>
      <address class="flex flex-col items-start gap-3 text-sm not-italic text-muted">
        <span>Ward-10, North Town, Chumoukedima, Nagaland - 797103</span>
        <a class="text-gold-deep hover:underline" href="mailto:korvianamail@gmail.com">korvianamail@gmail.com</a>
        <a class="text-gold-deep hover:underline" href="tel:+916909307616">+91-6909307616</a>
        <a class="text-gold-deep hover:underline" href="https://www.korviana.in/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">www.korviana.in</a>
      </address>
    </section>
  </main>
  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
